---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | ISO 28000"
  description="ISO 28000 supply chain security within social audits - secure supply chains and meet client security expectations through management systems."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/iso-28000/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367892/eurocert/b10.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 28000 Supply Chain Security"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Security Management Systems for the Supply Chain</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ISO 28000  -  Supply Chain Security</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Security management systems to ensure security in the supply chain.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Supply Chain Security  -  <span class="text-euro-600">ISO 28000</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 28000 specifies requirements for a security management system to ensure security in the supply chain, including aspects critical to the security assurance of the supply chain. It is applicable to all sizes of organizations, from small to multinational, in manufacturing, service, storage, or transportation at any stage of the production or supply chain.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Covers threat assessment, risk management, security planning, security implementation, and supply chain resilience.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-industry text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Key Elements</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">ISO 28000 addresses threat assessment, risk management, security planning, security implementation, and supply chain resilience  -  providing a comprehensive framework for securing supply chain operations.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784005211/iso28_mqzvei.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 28000 Supply Chain Security"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of ISO 28000 <span class="text-euro-600">Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-lock text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 28000 certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Globally recognized certification for supply chain security management systems.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shipping-fast text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply chain security management</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive framework to secure your supply chain operations.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Risk assessment &amp; mitigation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identify and address security risks across the supply chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Security system implementation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Implement robust security controls and procedures.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-search text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Threat &amp; vulnerability assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Systematic evaluation of threats and vulnerabilities.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Business continuity planning</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensure resilience and continuity of supply chain operations.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-truck text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Customs facilitation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Streamline customs processes and compliance requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">International trade security</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meet international security standards for global trade.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Certify with Eurocert?</h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in supply chain security management, ISO 28000"aligned programmes and related verification.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Our Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Eurocert has earned recognition by conducting supply chain security audits and ISO 28000 certifications for well-known companies for many years.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Certification by Eurocert means evaluation and acceptance by an accredited and well-respected third-party professional organization.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span>  -  a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/ctpat/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367934/eurocert/b9.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">C-TPAT</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Supply Chain Security</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/rmi/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;/b8.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">RMI</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Responsible Minerals</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/iso-37001/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367901/eurocert/b12.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 37001</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Anti-Bribery</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Our supply chain security experts are ready to guide your organization through ISO 28000 certification.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
